ure of yourself. Pupils took notes, raised their hands and, when invited, stood to answer or to ask their own questions.</p>","image":{"path":"assets/img/site/mentorship/lacekocot-0409.jpg","alt":"A woman in a patterned skirt speaking to rows of seated pupils","caption":"Speaking about growing up and health"},"link":{"label":"","url":""}},{"id":"lk03","type":"image","image":{"path":"assets/img/site/mentorship/lacekocot-0461.jpg","alt":"A mentor and a pupil standing facing each other during a discussion","caption":"A pupil joins the discussion"}},{"id":"lk04","type":"article","heading":"Boys and girls learning together","body_html":"<p>A practical talk on menstrual hygiene was held with boys and girls together, so that everyone understands what is normal, why it deserves respect and how to support a classmate or sister. Packs of sanitary pads were shared with the girls of the school.</p>","image":{"path":"assets/img/site/mentorship/lacekocot-0523.jpg","alt":"A mentor showing a reusable pad to the pupils during the demonstration","caption":"Showing how to use and care for pads"},"link":{"label":"","url":""}},{"id":"lk05","type":"image","image":{"path":"assets/img/site/mentorship/lacekocot-0553.jpg","alt":"Pupils gathered around a mentor holding a packet during the demonstration","caption":"Boys and girls learning together"}},{"id":"lk06","type":"divider"},{"id":"lk07","type":"article","heading":"Recognition and giving","body_html":"<p>A certificate of appreciation was presented, gift packs were handed over, and guests joined the pupils for a planting moment in the school compound, a small, lasting reminder of the day.</p>","image":{"path":"assets/img/site/mentorship/lacekocot-0570.jpg","alt":"A man holding a framed certificate while two women seated beside him smile","caption":"A certificate of appreciation is presented"},"link":{"label":"Read the full story","url":"/news/mentorship-session-at-lacekocot-primary-school"}},{"id":"lk08","type":"image","image":{"path":"assets/img/site/mentorship/lacekocot-0611.jpg","alt":"Pupils, teachers and mentors standing in rows in front of the school building","caption":"Everyone together at Lacekocot Primary School"}},{"id":"lk09","type":"article","heading":"Bring a mentorship session to your school","body_html":"<p>If you lead a school, a youth group or a community and would like a mentorship session, or you would like to volunteer as a mentor, we would love to hear from you.</p>","image":{"path":"","alt":"","caption":""},"link":{"label":"Contact us","url":"/contact"}},{"id":"lk10","type":"button","button":{"label":"Get involved","url":"/involvement","style":"primary"}}]}', 'published', '2026-10-23 09:00:00', 1) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE title = VALUES(title), summary = VALUES(summary), cover_image = VALUES(cover_image), cover_alt = VALUES(cover_alt);
